    <string name="help_title">Help &amp; Support</string>
    <string name="help_desc">Get help with the app</string>
    <string name="help_intro">We collected the most common questions to get you started fast.</string>
    <string name="help_questions_title">Frequently asked questions</string>
    <string name="faq_pair_title">How do I pair my child\'s device?</string>
    <string name="faq_pair_answer">Open the Circle tab, then choose Pair with QR or Scan network. Your child opens the Kid Guard app which shows a pairing QR code. When the device appears, tap it to connect.</string>
    <string name="faq_offline_title">Why can\'t I find my child\'s device?</string>
    <string name="faq_offline_answer">Make sure both phones are on the same Wi-Fi network and that the child app is running. If Wi-Fi is unavailable, pairing over Bluetooth works too.</string>
    <string name="faq_block_title">How do I block an app?</string>
    <string name="faq_block_answer">Open the device in your circle, go to the Apps tab, pick the app and press Block now, or Block for to choose a duration. Internet blocks only the app\'s network access.</string>
    <string name="faq_limits_title">How do I set time limits?</string>
    <string name="faq_limits_answer">In the Apps tab you can set a daily limit per app. Category limits and Take a Break rules give you even more control over screen time.</string>
    <string name="faq_icon_title">The child app icon disappeared</string>
    <string name="faq_icon_answer">It was hidden on purpose. From the child console you can unhide the icon, or your child can open the app from the recents screen.</string>
    <string name="faq_do_title">What are Device Owner controls?</string>
    <string name="faq_do_answer">Advanced parental controls such as managed limits and Wi-Fi control. They require setting the child device up as a managed device first — see the Device Owner setup guide.</string>
    <string name="faq_reports_title">Where do I find daily reports?</string>
    <string name="faq_reports_answer">Open the Insights tab. Daily reports appear once a paired device starts sharing its usage.</string>
    <string name="help_troubleshooting_title">Troubleshooting</string>
    <string name="help_troubleshooting_hint">Still stuck? These quick checks solve most issues.</string>
